			"Message": "build(Project): Update Cocoon and Sky submodules with build config and telemetry optimizations\n\nCoordinated submodule updates:\n\n- Cocoon: Add ESBuild/Cocoon.js and MountainConfig.js for extension host build pipeline and Mountain backend integration configuration\n- Sky: Refactor PostHogBridge to batch performance marks into 2-second intervals, preventing rate limiting during editor boot. Adds \"land:boot_marks\" bulk event and visibilitychange flush handler.\n\nThese changes enable the Cocoon extension host build process and improve PostHog telemetry reliability in the editor UI.",
